      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/ns#Skill",
      "name": "guideline-use-case",
      "title": "guideline-use-case",
      "description": "Stage 0 of smart-guideline-end-to-end: turn a request for a SMART Guideline into a use case — population, setting, jurisdiction and interventions in scope, new or an adaptation — in the requester's own words. The agent asks numbered questions for what the request did not say, and never invents the answer. Read when a guideline request arrives, before any L1 source is looked for.",
